{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "spanish", "appid": 548430, "month": "2019-12", "window": 4, "start_date": 1577145600, "end_date": 1577836799, "month_true_total": 31, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:04:41 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "60987189", "author": {"steamid": "76561198056968377", "personaname": "Numinosa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198056968377/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 1568, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 871, "last_played": 1698867397, "avatar": "75b9a80e5f62ed1ae248dd31fc20be4749a4b444"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Es un juego muy divertido para jugar con los amigos.", "timestamp_created": 1577797522, "timestamp_updated": 1577797522, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.522058844566345215", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "60955669", "author": {"steamid": "76561198068774980", "personaname": "Dead by u", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198068774980/", "num_games_owned": 1295, "num_reviews": 257, "playtime_forever": 1682, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 222, "last_played": 1745101535, "avatar": "020e6132d8d8749f4160c1a8904ef137b4f2390f"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Putos enanos mineros espaciales que se van borrachos de misión.\nQuitando eso, estamos ante un juego que se actualiza y que es capaz de sorprenderme constantemente. La generación de mapas es única, cada mapa generado aleatoriamente parecen hechos a mano, porque se ven muy especiales y diversos. Y la sensaciones que da cuando miras al techo y lo ves lleno de criaturas, o simplemente ves una formación de mapa que te llama la atención no tiene precio.\nEs uno de los mejores juegos que hay para jugar cooperativo con tus amigos, si no es el mejor ahora mismo", "timestamp_created": 1577756126, "timestamp_updated": 1606355571, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "60891798", "author": {"steamid": "76561198796552822", "personaname": "Arctic Fox", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198796552822/", "num_games_owned": 80, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 14920, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 183, "last_played": 1771103007, "avatar": "e3d58dc7f3bed72e9f8631eff07ac3ee9e0133eb"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Bastante entretenido si juegas con amigos", "timestamp_created": 1577686601, "timestamp_updated": 1577686601, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "60868848", "author": {"steamid": "76561198077948616", "personaname": "Harithan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Harithan/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 3173, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 780, "last_played": 1756315839, "avatar": "4691fbe920cd69d2b68b1bf2da140d896fb45f6d"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Fue una suerte enorme encontrarme este juego, es increíble. Deep Rock Galactic te mete en la piel de un minero enano (Y lo hace muy bien) que trabaja para la empresa que da nombre al juego, tendrás que abrirte paso a través de túneles generados de forma aleatoria en cada misión, minando minerales y excavando caminos nuevos mientras te defiendes de hordas de insectos gigantes con o sin tu equipo de compañeros enanos, aunque si no tienes a nadie con quien jugar siempre puedes buscar gente aleatoria o contar con la ayuda de Bosco, un droide que te será muy util en esas situaciones. \n\nEl juego es realmente immersivo, tiene muchísimos detalles que le dan mucha vida al juego, un montón de personalización y un apartado visual genial, y la banda sonora no se queda atrás.\n\n¡Lo recomiendo muchísimo!", "timestamp_created": 1577657737, "timestamp_updated": 1577657737, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "60705625", "author": {"steamid": "76561198063454782", "personaname": "fandosv", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198063454782/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 18339, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2000, "last_played": 1775163021, "avatar": "ae3b475531d3d31151b5b0c6484cbf6af466e874"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Un gran juego, infravalorado, muy divertido y adictivo. Lo recomiendo a todo el mundo que le gusten estos tipos de juegos como L4D pero con enanos.", "timestamp_created": 1577485519, "timestamp_updated": 1577485519, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}